#: style.css:1
msgid "A bilingual WordPress theme for creative agencies and studios. The initial language follows WordPress Site Language, with a visitor switcher for Persian and English and dedicated RTL styles. Includes a responsive landing page, editorial posts, and reading, wide, boxed, and full-width page templates with configurable width and spacing. Custom page widths are set per page. The full-width, single-save settings dashboard controls layout, colors, typography, uploaded WOFF2 fonts, header, pages, posts, blog, sidebars, and footer. Supports Elementor page templates and Theme Builder locations, with GitHub dashboard updates."
msgstr "A bilingual WordPress theme for creative agencies and studios. The initial language follows WordPress Site Language, with a visitor switcher for Persian and English and dedicated RTL styles. Includes a responsive landing page, editorial posts, and reading, wide, boxed, and full-width page templates with configurable width and spacing. Custom page widths are set per page. The full-width, single-save settings dashboard controls layout, colors, typography, uploaded WOFF2 fonts, header, pages, posts, blog, sidebars, and footer. Supports Elementor page templates and Theme Builder locations, with GitHub dashboard updates."

